1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:06,800
Answer some questions below.

2
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:12,300
Who was elected class monitor?

3
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:17,320
A. Van

4
00:00:17,470 --> 00:00:23,500
B. Quoc

5
00:00:24,770 --> 00:00:28,400
C. Lam

6
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:40,270
Answer: A. Van was elected class monitor.

7
00:00:41,470 --> 00:00:52,150
When Van was elected class monitor, how did the boys comment on Van?

8
00:00:53,220 --> 00:01:09,000
You read again the words the boys said about Van.

9
00:01:10,600 --> 00:01:21,170
Answer: The boys commented Van was skinny, short, quiet.

10
00:01:22,020 --> 00:01:31,620
In the boys' opinion, who makes a proper monitor?

11
00:01:32,570 --> 00:01:37,370
A. girl

12
00:01:37,900 --> 00:01:40,820
B. boy

13
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:53,720
Answer: The boys think the monitor must be a boy.

14
00:01:54,670 --> 00:02:07,120
This morning, why did Quoc not do class duty?

15
00:02:10,070 --> 00:02:21,420
Answer: Quoc woke up late, forgot the logbook.

16
00:02:22,170 --> 00:02:34,950
When running into class, Quoc was surprised because what?

17
00:02:36,650 --> 00:02:46,170
Answer: Quoc was surprised to see the classroom clean.

18
00:02:46,650 --> 00:02:56,870
Who came to class early and did duty to help Quoc?

19
00:02:58,270 --> 00:03:04,070
A. Lam

20
00:03:04,600 --> 00:03:10,000
B. Narrator "I"

21
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:13,770
C. Van

22
00:03:17,470 --> 00:03:24,470
That is your friend Van - the class monitor.

23
00:03:25,400 --> 00:03:36,700
In the afternoon labor, everyone was tired and thirsty, what did Van do?

24
00:03:36,700 --> 00:03:43,170
A. Bring water bottles.

25
00:03:43,520 --> 00:03:49,470
B. Buy ice cream for the whole class.

26
00:03:50,250 --> 00:03:55,920
C. Buy water for friends.

27
00:03:59,200 --> 00:04:08,420
Answer: Van bought ice cream and shared with everyone.

28
00:04:09,350 --> 00:04:18,350
Which sentence shows everyone in class is now proud of Van?

29
00:04:19,100 --> 00:04:26,070
A. Van was elected class monitor.

30
00:04:26,920 --> 00:04:33,420
B. The monitor must be quick.

31
00:04:34,200 --> 00:04:38,570
C. My class monitor is great!

32
00:04:41,200 --> 00:04:47,770
Answer: C. My class monitor is great!

